{"about_the_game":"<strong>TOMB OF THE DEAD</strong> is a brutal arcade shooter with a classic 90s look and feel. Mow down swarms of demonic monsters and survive for as long as you can.  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163600/extras/Tomb_of_the_Dead_mystery_carcass.gif?t=1666158051\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fleshy guttural sounds &amp; evil dark ambient!<br></li><li>Pure demon slaying madness!<br></li><li>Earn points to buy better flesh weapons from a mystery carcass.<br></li><li>Use headphones! Every sound made by weapons and demons is low frequency brutality!<br></li><li>Every enemy produces ultra low guttural pulsating sounds with a rhythm. Pay close attention to the bass heavy patterns and you will survive long enough to see the worm.<br></li><li>Shoot the evil spawn towers to increase the change to get ammo.<br></li><li>Floating rib cage heads will pulverize you in seconds if not fighting hard enough.<br></li><li>Buy open doors made out of guts and flesh to expand the tight map.<br></li><li>One hardcore achievement - make it to wave 10 and get on top of the giant worm that devours everything in its path!<br></li><li>Slay massive waves of undead creatures!</li></ul><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163600/extras/Tomb_of_the_Dead_end.gif?t=1666158051\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ride the Worm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2163600/45804d10371de18b706e9f2e2d5e9282058cd588.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2163600?t=1666158051","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2163600?t=1666158051","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163600/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1666158051","capsule_imagev5"